[ti:Tadbeer Barbaad]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Sufi & Qawwali]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Log kahte hain tere hone se meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[00:13.88]Log kahte hain... log kahte hain...
[00:19.75]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon ye goonge ke gud ka swaad hai
[00:25.63]Wo kahte hain diya hawa ke saamne kyun jalaye rakha hai
[00:31.50]Ye to bujh jayega, ye to mit jayega, ye to khaak mein mil jayega
[00:37.38]Main kahta hoon isi jalte rehne mein mere dil ka thikana hai
[00:43.26]Jalna hi jalna hai, jalna hi paana hai — bujhna to andhera hai
[00:49.13]Poochhte hain zakhm kyun nahi bhartaa, kyun hardam rota rehta hai
[00:55.01]Kya itna sasta hai tera dard ki har baazaar mein bikta hai
[01:00.88]Main kahta hoon har zakhm teri yaad ka kinaara hai
[01:06.76]Ghaav hi to wo aaina hai jisme tera chehra utarta hai
[01:12.63]Wo kahte hain ke diya baati ke mainu jalaye lagaa rakhya hai
[01:18.51]Hawa jab aavegi, ye diya bujh jaavega, sirf dhuan reh jaavega
[01:24.39]Main kahta hoon sakhi! ye jalna hi mere preetam ko paana hai
[01:30.26]Je diya bujh gaya, taan baati kya? saans lena hi bekaar hai
[01:36.14]Jogi ban ke aaya tha, preetam rang diya
[01:47.89]Barbaadi de vich goonge jiha har koi
[01:59.64]Gud ka swaad jaane par bole na
[02:11.39]Log kahte hain...
[02:23.15]Tere hone se...
[02:34.90]Meri tadbeer barbaad hai
[02:46.65]Unhe kaise samjhaaoon...
[02:58.40]Ye goonge ke gud ka swaad hai
[03:04.28]Hey Maula, hey Shah-e-Braj Nandlala
[03:10.15]Hey Khwaja Chishti di dargah da ujiyara
[03:16.03]Jehda preet vich goonga ho jaave
[03:21.90]Usnu gud da swaad baksh de
[03:27.78]Jehdi tadbeer barbaad ho jaave
[03:33.66]Usnu wafa da naam baksh de
[03:39.53]Ameen...
[03:45.41]Ameen...
[03:51.28]Ameen...
